"It's not the sort of thing you waste on a few uppity villagers. Against a veteran warrior such as yourself, however, it may come in handy... Hoho. Would you like to find out?"

pt:
//【小太郎】
<voice name='小太郎' class='小太郎' src='voice/ma02/0050590b35'>
//「血の気の多い村の若い衆なぞを相手に使う
